OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to ditch city's 'sanctuary'
OL,4,Astatus defended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has defended
OL,7,Fplans to withdraw Bradford Council from
OL,8,Fits City of Sanctuary status after
OL,9,Fopposition politicians accused the
OL,10,Fparty of promoting "hate and division".
OL,12,FThe Reform-led authority is considering
OL,13,Fending the accreditation, which was
OL,14,Fawarded in 2021 in recognition of
OL,15,FBradford's commitment to welcoming and
OL,16,Fsupporting refugees, asylum seekers and
OL,17,Fmigrants.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
