OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to ditch city's 'sanctuary'
OL,4,Astatus defended
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition councillors have condemned
OL,7,Fthe proposal, arguing it distracts from
OL,8,Flocal issues and undermines efforts to
OL,9,Fhelp newcomers settle into the
OL,10,Fcommunity.
OL,12,FBut Reform councillor Ian Walker said
OL,13,Fthe move was about "giving the people
OL,14,Fof Bradford through their elected
OL,15,Fmembers a say in how their future
OL,16,Flooks".
